  <entity00356361:DescriptionOfBorrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00356361_BankborrowingsMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_entity00356361_FunctionalcurrencyMemberOfFunctionalOrPresentationCurrencyMemberOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00356361_KoreaDevelopmentBankAndTheOtherMemberOfCounterpartiesMemberOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">KDB산업은행 일부 차입금에 대해서는 연결회사의 건물 등이 근저당 설정되어 있습니다(주석 11 참조).</entity00356361:DescriptionOfBorrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableTableOfItems>
  <entity00356361:DescriptionOfBorrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00356361_BankborrowingsMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CurrencyInWhichInformationIsDisplayedAxis_entity00356361_ForeignCurrencyMemberOfFunctionalOrPresentationCurrencyMemberOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableTableOfMember_ifrs-full_CounterpartiesAxis_entity00356361_AnzAndOthersMemberOfCounterpartiesMemberOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기 중 제너럴모터스(GM)가 연결회사의 미국 에너지부(DOE) 정책자금 차입금을 상환하였습니다.
당기말 현재 신디케이션론(ANZ/HSBC/JPM 등) 및 EIB의 장기차입 관련하여 연결회사는 약정에 따라 차입금이 전액 상환될 때까지 연결 재무비율의 유지(총 차입금/EBITDA 4배 미만) 등의 제약을 받으며 해당 차입 약정에 대한 재무약정을 미충족하여 장기차입금을 유동부채로 분류하였습니다.</entity00356361:DescriptionOfBorrowingsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableLineItemsOfDisclosureolongtermborrowingstableTableOfItems>
